# ✅ Real User Data Integration - Complete

## What Was Changed

### Problem
App was using hardcoded test values instead of actual logged-in user data:
```
Email: test@example.com
UserId: user123
Token: test_token_123
```

### Solution
Now uses real authenticated user data from Android login at every step.

---

## Changes Made

